    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0549",
      "reading_order": 708,
      "section": "6.1 UPS Room Management",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 77.904,
        "t": 632.5076629101563,
        "r": 541.2737599999996,
        "b": 607.436101363195
      },
      "content": "UPS room management includes environmental safety management and equipment management in UPS room.",
      "section_id": "sec_6_1",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_6",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_6",
          "title": "6 Maintenance"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_6_1",
          "title": "6.1 UPS Room Management"
        }
      ],
      "page": 70,
      "chunk_hint": "section_start",
      "semantic_role": "overview",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0550",
      "reading_order": 709,
      "section": "6.1 UPS Room Management",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 77.904,
        "t": 601.3076629101563,
        "r": 541.5371199999998,
        "b": 529.406101363195
      },
      "content": "Basic tasks of environmental safety management include: ensure ambient temperature, relative humidity,  clean  class,  electrostatic  interference,  noise,  and  strong  current  electromagnetic interference in UPS room can meet related requirements, guarantee stable performance, reliable operation,  and  safe  production  of  equipment,  and  assure  normal  power  supply  of  electric equipments.",
      "section_id": "sec_6_1",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_6",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_6",
          "title": "6 Maintenance"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_6_1",
          "title": "6.1 UPS Room Management"
        }
      ],
      "page": 70,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0551",
      "reading_order": 710,
      "section": "6.1 UPS Room Management",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 77.904,
        "t": 523.2776629101563,
        "r": 541.6147199999999,
        "b": 467.006101363195
      },
      "content": "Basic requirements of equipment management are: guarantee perfect mechanical performance of  equipment,  electric  performance  can  meet  related  standard  and  requirements,  stable  and reliable operation of equipment, and complete technical data and original records related to the equipment.",
      "section_id": "sec_6_1",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_6",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_6",
