    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0555",
      "reading_order": 714,
      "section": "6.3 Safety Precautions",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 77.904,
        "t": 266.4576629101563,
        "r": 541.3392799999995,
        "b": 225.78610136319492
      },
      "content": "To  safely  and  successfully  execute  maintenance  of  the  system,  it  must  follow  related  safety precautions,  use  necessary  tools  and  testing  devices,  be  operated  by  qualified  maintenance personal, and pay attention to following safe operation regulations:",
      "section_id": "sec_6_3",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_6",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_6",
          "title": "6 Maintenance"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_6_3",
          "title": "6.3 Safety Precautions"
        }
      ],
      "page": 70,
      "chunk_hint": "section_start",
      "semantic_role": "overview",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0556",
      "reading_order": 715,
      "section": "6.3 Safety Precautions",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 77.904,
        "t": 219.62766291015623,
        "r": 461.31568,
        "b": 210.15610136319492
      },
      "content": "Do remember it has danger voltage inside UPS even if it is not under operation.",
      "section_id": "sec_6_3",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_6",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_6",
          "title": "6 Maintenance"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_6_3",
          "title": "6.3 Safety Precautions"
        }
      ],
      "page": 70,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0557",
      "reading_order": 716,
      "section": "6.3 Safety Precautions",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 77.904,
        "t": 204.02766291015632,
        "r": 541.3085599999993,
        "b": 178.956101363195
      },
      "content": "Ensure  UPS  operations  and  maintenance  personal  must  be  familiar  with  the  equipment  and content of this manual.",
      "section_id": "sec_6_3",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_6",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_6",
          "title": "6 Maintenance"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_6_3",
          "title": "6.3 Safety Precautions"
        }
      ],
      "page": 70,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0558",
      "reading_order": 717,
      "section": "6.3 Safety Precautions",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 77.904,
        "t": 172.82766291015628,
        "r": 506.81568,
        "b": 163.35610136319497
      },
      "content": "Please do not wear metal or silver jewelries such as ring and watch when operating UPS.",
      "section_id": "sec_6_3",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_6",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_6",
          "title": "6 Maintenance"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_6_3",
          "title": "6.3 Safety Precautions"
        }
      ],
      "page": 70,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0559",
      "reading_order": 718,
      "section": "6.3 Safety Precautions",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 77.904,
        "t": 157.22766291015625,
        "r": 417.63568,
        "b": 147.75610136319494
      },
      "content": "Please study to personal who is familiar with it if there is any question.",
      "section_id": "sec_6_3",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_6",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_6",
          "title": "6 Maintenance"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_6_3",
          "title": "6.3 Safety Precautions"
        }
      ],
      "page": 70,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0560",
      "reading_order": 719,
      "section": "6.3 Safety Precautions",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 77.904,
        "t": 141.62766291015623,
        "r": 541.1500799999995,
        "b": 116.55610136319501
      },
      "content": "Be  careful  of  danger  voltage  inside  the  UPS,  and  inspect  and  ensure  power  supply  is  under safety status before taking maintenance and debugging.",
      "section_id": "sec_6_3",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_6",
